% agterm hotkeys

## Sessions

| Chord | Action |
| --- | --- |
| `Super+n` | New session with split: OpenCode left, shell right |
| `Super+Shift+w` | New workspace with split: OpenCode left, shell right |
| `Super+Shift+g` | Plain new session |
| `Super+w` | Close session |
| `Super+Shift+t` | Reopen recent session |
| `Super+z` | Undo close |
| `Super+Alt+up` / `Super+Alt+down` | Previous / next session |
| `Ctrl+Alt+up` / `Ctrl+Alt+down` | Previous / next attention session |

## View and panes

| Chord | Action |
| --- | --- |
| `Super+d` | Toggle split |
| `Super+Alt+left` / `Super+Alt+right` | Focus left / right pane |
| `Super+Shift+j` | Toggle scratch |
| `Super+Shift+d` | Dashboard |
| `Super+-` / `Super+0` | Decrease / reset font size |
| `Ctrl+Super+s` | Toggle sidebar |

## Palettes

| Chord | Action |
| --- | --- |
| `Ctrl+p` | Session palette |
| `Ctrl+Shift+p` | Command palette |
| `Ctrl+Shift+o` | Custom command palette |
| `Ctrl+Shift+i` | Attention list |
| `Ctrl+\`` | Quick terminal |

